{"name":"Warm Welcome","hex":"#ea9073","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"warm","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a somewhat high temperature, often but not always connoting that the high temperature is pleasant rather than uncomfortable.","Friendly and with affection."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make or keep warm.","To become warm, to heat up."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/warm"},{"term":"welcome","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Whose arrival is a cause of joy; received with gladness; admitted willingly to the house, entertainment, or company.","Producing gladness."]},{"part":"Interjection","definitions":["Greeting given upon someone's arrival.","Ellipsis of you're welcome.."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/welcome"}],"entries":[{"title":"Welcome","blocks":[{"text":"A welcome is a kind of greeting designed to introduce a person to a new place or situation, and to make them feel at ease. The term can similarly be used to describe the feeling of being accepted on the part of the new person."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Coir_mat1.jpg/330px-Coir_mat1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Welcome","wikidata":"Q13109234"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/2015-05-14_07_16_15_Welcome_to_Virginia_sign_on_southbound_Interstate_495_%28Capital_Beltway%29_in_McLean%2C_Virginia.jpg/500px-2015-05-14_07_16_15_Welcome_to_Virginia_sign_on_southbound_Interstate_495_%28Capital_Beltway%29_in_McLean%2C_Virginia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/2015-05-14_07_16_15_Welcome_to_Virginia_sign_on_southbound_Interstate_495_%28Capital_Beltway%29_in_McLean%2C_Virginia.jpg/1280px-2015-05-14_07_16_15_Welcome_to_Virginia_sign_on_southbo